{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The secrets are growing. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guide I.R.I.S., a gardening robot lost to time, to unearth the secrets of her overgrown world. Solve plant-based puzzles using your water spout, and untangle events through environmental storytelling, in this atmospheric journey</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Plant-Based Puzzles</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse the world by solving plant-based puzzles, and bring nature back into the uninhabitable.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Water Physics</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using her water spout, IRIS can shoot out water streams to interact with her environment. Grow plants, fill in gaps, and push objects to advance past any obstacle in your way.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Environmental Story-telling</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover what happened decades into the past as you travel across a world left in ruin.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3962610?t=1756056598","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3962610?t=1756056598","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962610/b5ada12166343c15e28e75ec0bd9e484f19f804b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756056598","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962610/b5ada12166343c15e28e75ec0bd9e484f19f804b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756056598","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Occasional depictions of human remains"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The secrets are growing. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guide I.R.I.S., a gardening robot